  "why": "EURUSD price is 60s old. Web excludes p2 from equity AND margin (500%, no action). Rust excludes it from equity but still counts its margin at open price (1000/2400 = 41.7%) -> stop-out closes the only priced position p1 (P&L 0), then gets stuck on unpriced p2.",
